ll,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552783192,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7930},{"id":1778551801636,"text":"你看着镜子里，自己是如何在他身//下承//欢，如何被他撞得摇摇欲坠，如何在他达到顶峰时，发出破碎的呻//吟。","rawContent":"你看着镜子里，自己是如何在他身//下承//欢，如何被他撞得摇摇欲坠，如何在他达到顶峰时，发出破碎的呻//吟。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552787722,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7931},{"id":1778551801637,"text":"你看到了自己最放//荡、最沉//沦的一面。","rawContent":"你看到了自己最放//荡、最沉//沦的一面。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552791592,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7932},{"id":1778551801638,"text":"而这一切，都是因为身后的这个男人。","rawContent":"而这一切，都是因为身后的这个男人。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552796122,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7933},{"id":1778551801639,"text":"在极致的快//感中，你彻底失去了意识。","rawContent":"在极致的快//感中，你彻底失去了意识。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552800082,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7934},{"id":1778551801640,"text":"---","rawContent":"---","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552801432,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7935},{"id":1778551801641,"text":"你醒来的时候，发现自己躺在卧室的大床上，身上已经被清理干净，换上了干净的真丝睡裙。","rawContent":"你醒来的时候，发现自己躺在卧室的大床上，身上已经被清理干净，换上了干净的真丝睡裙。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552805964,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7936},{"id":1778551801642,"text":"陆驰就躺在你的身边，从后面抱着你。他的下巴抵在你的发顶，呼吸平稳，似乎已经睡着了。","rawContent":"陆驰就躺在你的身边，从后面抱着你。他的下巴抵在你的发顶，呼吸平稳，似乎已经睡着了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552810492,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7937},{"id":1778551801643,"text":"你动了动，感觉浑身都像是被卡车碾过一样，酸痛不已。尤其是某个不可言说的地方，又//肿又//痛。","rawContent":"你动了动，感觉浑身都像是被卡车碾过一样，酸痛不已。尤其是某个不可言说的地方，又//肿又//痛。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552815021,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7938},{"id":1778551801644,"text":"你心里又气又委屈，转过身，狠狠地在他胸口捶了一下。","rawContent":"你心里又气又委屈，转过身，狠狠地在他胸口捶了一下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:26","timestamp":1778552819552,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7939},{"id":1778551801645,"text":"他闷哼了一声，睁开了眼睛。","rawContent":"他闷哼了一声，睁开了眼睛。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552822732,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7940},{"id":1778551801646,"text":"“醒了？”他的声音还带着刚睡醒的沙哑，听上去却温柔得不可思议。","rawContent":"“醒了？”他的声音还带着刚睡醒的沙哑，听上去却温柔得不可思议。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552827261,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7941},{"id":1778551801647,"text":"“陆驰你这个混蛋！变//态！大//色//狼！”你把所有能想到的骂人的词都用上了。","rawContent":"“陆驰你这个混蛋！变//态！大//色//狼！”你把所有能想到的骂人的词都用上了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552831793,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7942},{"id":1778551801648,"text":"他也不反驳，只是任由你打，任由你骂。等你自己骂累了，才把你重新捞回怀里，紧紧地抱着。","rawContent":"他也不反驳，只是任由你打，任由你骂。等你自己骂累了，才把你重新捞回怀里，紧紧地抱着。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552836324,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7943},{"id":1778551801649,"text":"“对不起。”他在你耳边说，“今天，是我失控了。”","rawContent":"“对不起。”他在你耳边说，“今天，是我失控了。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552840852,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7944},{"id":1778551801650,"text":"你趴在他怀里，眼泪又忍不住掉了下来。","rawContent":"你趴在他怀里，眼泪又忍不住掉了下来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552844991,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7945},{"id":1778551801651,"text":"“我看到你和他在咖啡馆里，他把书递给你的时候，碰到了你的手。”他的声音很低，“我当时就想冲过去，把他那只手给废了。”","rawContent":"“我看到你和他在咖啡馆里，他把书递给你的时候，碰到了你的手。”他的声音很低，“我当时就想冲过去，把他那只手给废了。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552849522,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7946},{"id":1778551801652,"text":"“你跟踪我？”","rawContent":"“你跟踪我？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552852042,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7947},{"id":1778551801653,"text":"“不是跟踪。”他叹了口气，“我给你订了那家湘菜，想提前过去排队，顺便在你公司楼下等你，给你个惊喜。结果，就看到了那一幕。”","rawContent":"“不是跟踪。”他叹了口气，“我给你订了那家湘菜，想提前过去排队，顺便在你公司楼下等你，给你个惊喜。结果，就看到了那一幕。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552856573,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7948},{"id":1778551801654,"text":"“你为什么不当面问我？”","rawContent":"“你为什么不当面问我？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552859421,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7949},{"id":1778551801655,"text":"“我不敢。”他说，“我怕我一开口，就会说出什么让你难堪的话。我更怕……怕你告诉我，你对他旧情难忘。”","rawContent":"“我不敢。”他说，“我怕我一开口，就会说出什么让你难堪的话。我更怕……怕你告诉我，你对他旧情难忘。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552863966,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7950},{"id":1778551801656,"text":"你没想到，这个在外人面前永远冷静自持的男人，在感情里，竟然会如此患得患失。","rawContent":"你没想到，这个在外人面前永远冷静自持的男人，在感情里，竟然会如此患得患失。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552868482,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7951},{"id":1778551801657,"text":"“我没有。”你把脸埋在他的胸口，声音闷闷的，“我和他早就结束了。今天只是还书，真的没有别的。”","rawContent":"“我没有。”你把脸埋在他的胸口，声音闷闷的，“我和他早就结束了。今天只是还书，真的没有别的。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552873011,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7952},{"id":1778551801658,"text":"“我知道。”他亲了亲你的头发，“我知道你不是那样的人。是我自己……是我自己太小气，太没有安全感。”","rawContent":"“我知道。”他亲了亲你的头发，“我知道你不是那样的人。是我自己……是我自己太小气，太没有安全感。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:27","timestamp":1778552877541,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7953},{"id":1778551801659,"text":"他顿了顿，又说：“但是知意，我还是要你答应我一件事。”","rawContent":"他顿了顿，又说：“但是知意，我还是要你答应我一件事。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:28","timestamp":1778552882072,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7954},{"id":1778551801660,"text":"“什么？”","rawContent":"“什么？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:28","timestamp":1778552884083,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7955},{"id":1778551801661,"text":"“以后，不管发生什么事，都不要瞒着我。好的，坏的，我都要第一个知道。你可以骂我小气，骂我神经病，但你不能把我排除在你的世界之外。”","rawContent":"“以后，不管发生什么事，都不要瞒着我。好的，坏的，我都要第一个知道。你可以骂我小气，骂我神经病，但你不能把我排除在你的世界之外。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:28","timestamp":1778552888611,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7956},{"id":1778551801662,"text":"他的声音里，带着一丝不易察觉的脆弱和恳求。","rawContent":"他的声音里，带着一丝不易察觉的脆弱和恳求。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:28","timestamp":1778552893022,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7957},{"id":1778551801663,"text":"“好。”你点了点头，主动收紧了抱着他的手臂，“我答应你。以后什么都告诉你，再也不让你胡思乱想了。”","rawContent":"“好。”你点了点头，主动收紧了抱着他的手臂，“我答应你。以后什么都告诉你，再也不让你胡思乱想了。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:28","timestamp":1778552897561,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7958},{"id":1778551801664,"text":"“嗯。”","rawContent":"“嗯。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:28","timestamp":1778552899382,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7959},{"id":1778551801665,"text":"他得到了你的保证，像是终于放下心来，在你额头上落下一个珍而重之的吻。","rawContent":"他得到了你的保证，像是终于放下心来，在你额头上落下一个珍而重之的吻。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:28","timestamp":1778552903911,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7960},{"id":1778551801666,"text":"“睡吧。”他说，“明天，我们哪也不去，就在家待着。”","rawContent":"“睡吧。”他说，“明天，我们哪也不去，就在家待着。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:28","timestamp":1778552908443,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","g